        "RssChannelItemComments": "http://lifestylexpressonline.com/babyfood/#respond",
        "RssChannelItemCreator": "Vanessa Freeman",
        "RssChannelItemDescriptionP": "Meal planning and cooking has literally become an on-call, part-time job for most, and many moms are feeding both adult and little mouths.  As a new mom, I need all…",
        "RssChannelItemDescriptionPA": "No Fuss, Freezer-Friendly Baby Food Recipes",
        "RssChannelItemDescriptionPAHref": "http://lifestylexpressonline.com/babyfood/",
        "RssChannelItemDescriptionPARel": "nofollow",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedDiv": "When I was pregnant with Zaid, she had just given birth to Noah.  In all of her new mom delirium, she somehow managed to answer all of my crazy questions and concerns about my impending delivery.  Our text messages back and forth during my maternity leave kept me sane, and laughing for days.  Since then, the questions certainly haven’t stopped. During this challenging time being in quarantine with infants, Vanessa came through with some homemade baby food recipes. These recipes helped her keep Noah fed and happy throughout the day.  I’ve also included a couple of my own go-to recipes as well!",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedDivA": "Vanessa Malzahn!",
