        "RssChannelItemEncodedDivStyle": "padding-left: 40px;",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedDivUlLi": "We’ve been quarantined for almost a month, and ordering baby food on Amazon has been a disaster. It takes forever for anything to come, or the price is exorbitant, or it’s just not available.",
