        "RssChannelItemEncodedPImgWidth": 1024,
        "RssChannelItemEncodedPSpanId": "more-1745",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedUlLi": "I make the food in batches and freeze them – that way I can make a lot at a time and it saves without any preservatives.",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedUlLiA": "Amazon – here is the link",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedUlLiAHref": "https://www.amazon.com/Storage-Containers-Reusable-Microwave-Dishwasher/dp/B07VYBQFNV/ref=sr_1_1_sspa?crid=38QB0F0CYDK3F&dchild=1&keywords=glass+jars+for+baby+food&qid=1586382569&s=baby-products&sprefix=glass+jar%2Cbaby-products%2C137&sr=1-1-spons&psc=1&spLa=ZW5jcnlwdGVkUXVhbGlmaWVyPUEyWDM3S1RHWkxNWDkmZW5jcnlwdGVkSWQ9QTAxMjY4NDkzTFA4WElNOE9YMUVHJmVuY3J5cHRlZEFkSWQ9QTAyMTAyMjMzRzkzNlpCWFJJNzk4JndpZGdldE5hbWU9c3BfYXRmJmFjdGlvbj1jbGlja1JlZGlyZWN0JmRvTm90TG9nQ2xpY2s9dHJ1ZQ==",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedUlLiARev": "en_rl_none",
        "RssChannelItemEncodedUlLiDiv": "I too have been buying frozen and organic veggies and fruits for Zaid.  We have a bit of a family grocery store pool going, so about once a week I’ll get a fresh round of fruits to puree.  My favorites are apple, pear and mango.  I typically get the organic frozen mangoes at Trader Joes.",
